<title>USA: AirTouch Q1 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>AirTouch Q1 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.13		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			 64,000		   52,000</p>
<p> Revs		     836,000		  449,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 502,811		  498,837</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is AirTouch Communications Inc.</p>
<p>Net figures above refer to net income available to common stockholders.</p>
<p>On a proportionate accounting basis, operating cash flow was $413 million for Q1 1997 vs $239 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.11.</p>
</text>
